{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36588","headline":"秋日有酬 · 罗隐","name":"秋日有酬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧业传家有宝刀，近闻余力更挥毫。\n腰间印佩黄金重，卷里诗裁白雪高。\n讌罢嘉宾迎凤藻，猎归诸将问龙韬。\n分茅列土才三十，犹拟廻头赌锦袍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36588.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36588","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}